  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "*Added Version ``GracefulParse(string)`` and ``TryGraceParse(string, out Version?)`` static extension member methods\n* Added ``FileInfo`` ``GetDirectory`` extension method - This method throws an exception if the file does not exist, and a not null directory value otherwise\n* Added String ``ContainsDelimitedSubStrings`` method\n* Added DateOnly ``DaysInYear`` extension \n* Added string ``IsEscapeCharacter(string)`` static extension member method\n* Updated DotPrimitives version from 4.2.0 to 4.3.0\n* Improved string escape character removal method performance\n* Deprecated string ``ContainsSpaceSeparatedSubStrings`` method for removal in v10\n* Deprecated DateTime ``DaysInYear`` static extension member method for removal in v10 - This will be replaced by a non extension member C# 14 type extension method\n* Deprecated SecureString ``SetString`` and ``AppendString`` methods for removal in v10",
